{"content": {"associated": {"p1": [{"aid": "167926885", "attribs": {"data-aid": "167926885", "id": "p_wMOx4"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/36-1-corinthians-8-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_mERPr-p_kqxxl#p_mERPr\" data-publication=\"1 Corinthians 8–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/nxp54h7iqjzipzm79ws5zgt5nhp700euwzwwefk4/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">What is charity?</a>"}, "heading": "What is charity?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/36-1-corinthians-8-13?lang=eng&id=p_mERPr-p_kqxxl#p_mERPr", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"162245565\" id=\"p_mERPr\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/nt/1-cor/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/1-cor/13.html?id=p1#p1\">1&nbsp;Corinthians 13:1</a></p></div>", "id": "p_wMOx4", "key": "p1", "marker": "1", "meta": {"authorName": "", "publication": "Scripture Helps: New Testament"}, "pid": "128385546", "title": "1 Corinthians 8–13", "type": "paragraphMedia"}, {"aid": "167926886", "attribs": {"data-aid": "167926886", "id": "p_dupgT"}, "childHTML": {"__html": "<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/36-1-corinthians-8-13?lang=eng&amp;id=p_cPQC8-p_kVfwE#p_cPQC8\" data-publication=\"1 Corinthians 8–13\" img-ref=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/nxp54h7iqjzipzm79ws5zgt5nhp700euwzwwefk4/full/%21500%2C/0/default\">What importance did Paul place on the gift of charity?</a>"}, "heading": "What importance did Paul place on the gift of charity?", "href": "/study/manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/36-1-corinthians-8-13?lang=eng&id=p_cPQC8-p_kVfwE#p_cPQC8", "html": "<div class=\"inlineRefContent\"><p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"162245580\" id=\"p_cPQC8\"><a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/scriptures/nt/1-cor/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p1-p3#p1\" data-old-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/1-cor/13.html?id=p1-p3#p1\">1&nbsp;Co